{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果宣佈將進一步完善App Store應用年齡分級體系。從2026年11月16日起，開發者在提交應用年齡評級問卷時，必須明確披露應用是否包含「位置共享」或「約會與關係」相關功能，以便系統為應用分配更準確的年齡分級。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584828.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:42:33.618201+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:36:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:38:44.484281+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:38:44.484281+00:00","content_hash":"c46ce3cb554aedf1553b7371b0d238edff64ba6a59d1ad0d65ceb23cf7d15a52","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}